      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pain is valid, yet even ash holds the remnants of what was once great. Find strength in letting go, for peace often arrives only after the fury of loss has finally exhausted itself. Allow yourself to rest, knowing that your journey ends here, and the next chapter begins in silence.",
