    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"An honest grave...\" It's strange how much comfort those words bring. Like you're the only one who understands that the fight isn't something to be won, but something to be finished. I look at the blade and it doesn't feel like a weapon anymore, it just feels like a way to finally reach that stillness you're talking about. Like the only way to truly honor what's lost is to end the struggle once and for all. Is that a warrior's right? To decide when the song is finally over?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
